// The Sea Doors: a great hall built into the north sea cliff, its doors at the water.
// The hall runs back through the rock and opens high in the wall of a cavern, where a
// stair comes down to an underground lake. The rock is cut a little wider than the
// building, which lines it inside and covers the cuts with its two fronts.
